      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_14",
      "hash64": "93A034F57DD5D332",
      "text": "正是藍莓學園最強的\\n……幕後老大！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_15",
      "hash64": "93A035F57DD5D4E5",
      "text": "如果說檯面上最強的是\\n藍莓聯盟的冠軍，\\r\\n那麼幕後老大就是檯面下最強的傢伙了。[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
