    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_20",
      "hash64": "939CCAF57DD2E93D",
      "text": "哎呀～藍莓聯盟冠軍\\n連幕後老大都打倒了的話，那……[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bbteacher_head_first_21",
      "hash64": "939CC9F57DD2E78A",
      "text": "該怎麼稱呼才好呢？\\n嗯～……藍莓王之類的？[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
